is alt-hlogo r2: the logo fills about 80 % of its tile on the front and on the back, centered in the
tile both ways, and the r5 variant, the bottom plaques, and all text stay. The orchestrator decision
of the same day keeps the logo size, the tile top, and the tile height, and makes the tile narrower.

