test output dropped the Thai lines first. No week file was read by hand.

The test file `dashboard/__tests__/quest-cover-hlogo.test.ts` holds the tests A1 to A9. A4 replaces
the tile width band with the tile top, the tile height, and the inner tile aspect. A6 adds the inner
tile width share of 78 % to 82 % and narrows the inner height share to the same band. A9 is new: it
hashes the hlogo render of each kind with the one logo tile element cut out, so the plaques and all
text stay. The 4 A9 pins came from the role base with the same cut method.

